            "name": "UiPath List Test Executions in a Project",
            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves test execution results within a specific test project. Test executions represent runs of test sets and contain the aggregate pass/fail status across all included test cases. References to individual test case log objects are included for drill-down.",
